 "notes": "Leemslagenplas at Almelo: the underwater course from the entry at the end of the access road on the east bank, with boat wrecks at 4.5-12 m, a platform, the UK269 Urk cutter at 22-24 m (buoys on the fore and aft deck) and the canyon drop-off at 27 m; the lake bottom is to the west of the entry. Shoreline from OpenStreetMap; depth lines are schematic and all positions are approximate. The UK-JE (9 m, sunk 2014) is not drawn.",
